, plazas) ~30 km south of Lima with an on-site museum; easy half-day.","bookable_category":"DMC/Viator day tour","tier":"comfort","source":"https://kaypiperutours.com/must-visit-attractions-in-lima/","timing":"year-round","timing_type":"ALWAYS-ON","si":"culture","blurb":"Vast pre-Inca/Inca pilgrimage city (pyramids, temples, plazas) ~30 km south of Lima with an on-site museum; easy half-day.","when":"year-round","commission":"DMC 10-12% / affiliate 4-8%; site entry pass-through","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["culture"],"shelf_fit":{"culinary":"destination","culture":"primary","expedition":"destination","romance":"destination"},"commission_pct_low":10,"commission_pct_high":12,"commission_lane":["DMC","affiliate"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"band+lane"},{"name":"Callao Monumental street-art district","status":"future","hook":"Regenerated Callao port-district arts quarter - murals, galleries and design studios in old republican buildings; go with a vetted tour.","bookable_category":"guided art tour (zone awareness)","tier":"comfort","source":"https://kaypiperutours.com/must-visit-attractions-in-lima/","timing":"year-round","timing_type":"ALWAYS-ON","si":"culture","blurb":"Regenerated Callao port-district arts quarter - murals, galleries and design studios in old republican buildings; go with a vetted tour.","when":"year-round","commission":"DMC/affiliate 4-10%; confirm live tour product + safe corridor","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["culture"],"shelf_fit":{"culinary":"destination","culture":"primary","expedition":"destination","romance":"destination"},"commission_pct_low":4,"commission_pct_high":10,"commission_lane":["DMC","affiliate"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"band+lane"},{"name":"Barranco + Puente de los Suspiros","status":"live","hook":"Bohemian seafront district - murals, galleries, the romance-legend Bridge of Sighs and sunset bars; Lima''s honeymoon base.","bookable_category":"self-guided within corridor / guided art walk","tier":"luxury","source":"https://kaypiperutours.com/must-visit-attractions-in-lima/","si":"romance","blurb":"Bohemian seafront district - murals, galleries, the romance-legend Bridge of Sighs and sunset bars; Lima''s honeymoon base.","commission":"pairs with Hotel B/Barranco boutique stay (hotel AOR); walk affiliate 4-8%","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["culture","romance"],"shelf_fit":{"culinary":"destination","culture":"evidenced","expedition":"destination","romance":"primary"},"commission_pct_low":4,"commission_pct_high":8,"commission_lane":["affiliate","hotel"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"band+lane"},{"name":"Miraflores Malecon + Parque del Amor at sunset","status":"live","hook":"Clifftop coastal promenade above the Pacific with the mosaic ''Park of Love'' - the classic Lima romance postcard, free.","bookable_category":"free / paired with clifftop dinner","tier":"essential","source":"https://kaypiperutours.com/must-visit-attractions-in-lima/","si":"romance","blurb":"Clifftop coastal promenade above the Pacific with the mosaic ''Park of Love'' - the classic Lima romance postcard, free.","commission":"bundled into commissionable romance program / dinner","wells":["eat"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["culinary","romance"],"shelf_fit":{"culinary":"evidenced","culture":"destination","expedition":"destination","romance":"primary"},"commission_lane":["bundle"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Tandem paragliding off the Miraflores cliffs","status":"live","hook":"Guided tandem flight over the Costa Verde clifftops and Pacific from the ~80 m Miraflores launch - the signature Lima adventure.","bookable_category":"reputable tandem operator / Viator (guided-only)","tier":"premier","source":"https://pariwana-hostel.com/en/blog/2025/10/07/paragliding-in-lima-a-complete-guide-to-flying-over-the-costa-verde/","si":"expedition","blurb":"Guided tandem flight over the Costa Verde clifftops and Pacific from the ~80 m Miraflores launch - the signature Lima adventure.","commission":"affiliate 4-8% / DMC 10-12%","wells":["fly","activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["culture","expedition"],"shelf_fit":{"culinary":"destination","culture":"evidenced","expedition":"primary","romance":"destination"},"commission_pct_low":4,"commission_pct_high":8,"commission_lane":["DMC","affiliate"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"band+lane","si_basis":"the dossier''s own SI block filed this jewel under a heading resolving to ''culture'' via her display name. Not a keyword match on the jewel text."},{"name":"Costa Verde surf lesson","status":"live","hook":"Guided surf school on the Miraflores/Barranco beach breaks (Makaha/Waikiki); cold-water summer swell, certified instructor + wetsuit.","bookable_category":"surf school / Viator (guided-only)","tier":"comfort","source":"https://pariwana-hostel.com/en/blog/2025/10/07/paragliding-in-lima-a-complete-guide-to-flying-over-the-costa-verde/","si":"expedition","blurb":"Guided surf school on the Miraflores/Barranco beach breaks (Makaha/Waikiki); cold-water summer swell, certified instructor + wetsuit.","commission":"affiliate 4-8%","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["culture","expedition"],"shelf_fit":{"culinary":"destination","culture":"evidenced","expedition":"primary","romance":"destination"},"commission_pct_low":4,"commission_pct_high":8,"commission_lane":["affiliate"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"band+lane","si_basis":"the dossier''s own SI block filed this jewel under a heading resolving to ''culture'' via her display name. Not a keyword match on the jewel text."}],"faq":[{"q":"How do I actually get a table at Maido, Central or Kjolle?","a":"Book weeks ahead — the tables are the binding constraint, not the hotel. Central, Maido and Kjolle open reservations on a rolling monthly/multi-week basis and sell out, so the culinary itinerary must be built reservation-first; grey winter is fine because the dining is indoors.","source":"ohlalima.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"culinary","accessed":"2026-07-07"},{"q":"What can I see in Lima in a day or two?","a":"More than you''d expect for a gateway city. Walk to Huaca Pucllana (a ~200–700 AD adobe pyramid in Miraflores), the Convento de San Francisco (founded 1540) catacombs in the UNESCO Centro Histórico, and the Larco Museum''s 5,000-year pre-Columbian collection in an 18th-century mansion.","source":"kaypiperutours.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"culture","accessed":"2026-07-07"},{"q":"Is Lima good for a honeymoon?","a":"Yes — the base is bohemian Barranco, Lima''s most walkable, romantic district, home to the Puente de los Suspiros (\"Bridge of Sighs\") and to Hotel B, a restored 1914 Belle Époque arts-mansion that is the city''s only Relais & Châteaux.","source":"relaischateaux.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"romance","accessed":"2026-07-07"},{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for in Lima?","a":"Urban street crime, not any activity. Stay in Miraflores, Barranco and San Isidro; use only registered radio-taxis, ride-hail apps or hotel transfers — never an unmarked street taxi, the classic express-kidnapping setup (forced ATM withdrawals over 1–3 hours). Use in-bank ATMs and keep valuables out of sight.","source":"bushop.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"safety","accessed":"2026-07-07"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Lima Peru Travel Guide 2026 — World''s #1 Restaurant, Pre-Inca Ruins & Barranco | TravelWell.World","meta_description":"Plan Lima, Peru: the world''s #1 restaurant (Maido), Central, Kjolle and La Mar; pre-Inca Huaca Pucllana, Larco Museum and Pachacamac; bohemian Barranco; luxury Belmond & Relais & Chateaux stays","slug":"lima-peru","jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-07-07","search_language":["en","es-PE"],"local_keywords":["qué hacer en Lima","mejores restaurantes Lima","Barranco Miraflores","Puente de los Suspiros","tour Huaca Pucllana","Museo Larco","Pachacámac desde Lima","parapente Costa Verde Lima","mejor época para viajar a Lima","cebicherías Lima","pisco sour Lima"],"hreflang":["en","es-PE"],"attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-07-07","last_verified_basis":"source_verified","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/peru","read":"2026-08-20T14:53:51Z","source_updated":"2026-06-22T23:35:12+01:00"}]}},"booking":{"advisory_authority":"FCDO"},"si_checklist_25":null,"sis_present":[{"si":"romance","status":"live"},{"si":"expedition","status":"live"},{"si":"culinary","status":"future"},{"si":"culture","status":"future"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Miraflores Park, A Belmond Hotel","why_ultra":"82-room clifftop Pacific-Riviera flagship in Miraflores; boutique service + full-luxury amenities; Lima''s iconic ultra address and a Belmond = Virtuoso-preferred flag (CLAUDE.md moat)","earning":"on application / host-Virtuoso or Fora (Amex FHR-listed)","virtuoso_value_add":"Virtuoso-preferred / consortia amenities where eligible (verify)","mor":true,"tier":"ultra"},{"name":"Hotel B","why_ultra":"Lima''s only Relais & Chateaux - restored 1914 Belle Epoque arts-mansion in Barranco, connected to the Lucia de la Puente gallery; the romance/honeymoon ultra pick","earning":"on application / Fora or Relais & Chateaux consortia where eligible","virtuoso_value_add":"consortia amenities where eligible (verify)","mor":true,"tier":"ultra"},{"name":"Country Club Lima Hotel","why_ultra":"f