es, including Autlán de Navarro, Sayula, Tapalpa, Cocula and Villa Corona — the advisory lists each by name."},{"name":"In Jalisco: eleven northern municipalities","lvl":3,"posture":"all-but-essential","note":"Bolaños, Chimaltitán, Colotlán, Hostotipaquillo, Huejúcar, Huequilla el Alto, Mezquitic, San Martín de Bolaños, Santa María de los Ángeles, Totatiche and Villa Guerrero."},{"name":"The state of Colima","lvl":3,"posture":"all-but-essential","except":["the city of Manzanillo by sea, or by air via Manzanillo-Costalegre International Airport","direct travel via road 200 from that airport to Manzanillo"]},{"name":"The state of Guerrero, including the city of Acapulco","lvl":3,"posture":"all-but-essential","except":["the town of Zihuatanejo/Ixtapa accessed by air"]},{"name":"Within 40km of the Guatemalan border, from the Pacific Coast up to and including the Gracias a Dios crossing","lvl":3,"posture":"all-but-essential"},{"name":"Federal Highway 199 between Rancho Nuevo, outside San Cristóbal de las Casas, and the Chancalá junction outside Palenque","lvl":3,"posture":"all-but-essential","note":"The restriction is the highway segment, not the towns at either end."}],"dive_emergency_numbers_verified":{"read":"2026-08-30","numbers":{"+1-919-684-9111":"DAN 24/7 emergency hotline — dan.org/about-dan/contact/, read 2026-08-30"},"_rule":"Each number above was read from the authority named beside it on the date shown. ⛔ A number with no entry here has NOT been verified and must not be presented as an emergency contact."}},"timing":{"peak":"Dive peak May-Sep (viz ~15-30m; croc encounter hard window Jun 1-Sep 30)","shoulder":"Apr and Oct edges","green":"Nov-Mar (wind/swell; Chinchorro often blown out - fall back to Costa Maya/Xcalak reef)","booking_lead":"4-6 months for permit-limited summer Chinchorro/croc product (permit scarcity = longer lead than a general reef trip)","off_season_specials":"winter Nov-Mar: Costa Maya/Xcalak mainland-reef dive days + no-fly beach fill-the-beds (lean Xcalak, south of the cruise port)","event_peaks":"croc window Jun 1-Sep 30; (Costa Maya cruise day-crowds peak Sep-Dec, busiest Nov, Wed/Thu - OUT of TWW scope, plan dive departures around it)","fire_date":"live by Dec-Jan, ~4-6 months ahead of the May-Sep dive window; run a winter Xcalak-reef value campaign for Nov-Mar fill-the-beds"},"jewels":[{"name":"Chinchorro overnight palafito expedition (Cayo Centro)","status":"live","bookable_category":"multi-day dive expedition","tier":"premier","source":"https://pepedivemahahual.com/en/diving/chinchorro/","timing":"Dive peak May-Sep","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"multi-day dive with stilt-hut overnight on the atoll ·","si":"liveaboard","blurb":"multi-day dive with stilt-hut overnight on the atoll ·","when":"Dive peak May-Sep","commission":"on application (liveaboard-reseller/dive-op host)","wells":["stay","activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["diveglobal","liveaboard"],"shelf_fit":{"diveglobal":"evidenced","liveaboard":"primary"},"commission_lane":["operator"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"~200-wreck atoll dives","status":"live","bookable_category":"wreck/wall diving","tier":"premier","source":"https://xtcdivecenter.com/chinchorro/","timing":"Dive peak May-Sep","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"liveaboard","when":"Dive peak May-Sep","commission":"dive-op host ~10-20% / on application","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["diveglobal","liveaboard"],"shelf_fit":{"diveglobal":"evidenced","liveaboard":"primary"},"commission_pct_low":10,"commission_pct_high":20,"commission_lane":["operator"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"band+lane"},{"name":"Chinchorro day-boat 2-3 tank + Cayo Centro","status":"live","bookable_category":"day dive charter","tier":"comfort","source":"https://xtcdivecenter.com/chinchorro/","timing":"Dive peak May-Sep","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"state day-trip, 2-tank $275 / 3-tank $325, Cayo Centro surface stop ·","si":"diveglobal","blurb":"state day-trip, 2-tank $275 / 3-tank $325, Cayo Centro surface stop ·","when":"Dive peak May-Sep","commission":"dive-op host / affiliate","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["diveglobal","liveaboard"],"shelf_fit":{"diveglobal":"primary","liveaboard":"evidenced"},"commission_lane":["operator","affiliate"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Costa Maya / Xcalak reef diving","status":"live","bookable_category":"day dive charter","tier":"comfort","source":"https://amigosdelmar.net/","timing":"Dive peak May-Sep","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"diveglobal","when":"Dive peak May-Sep","commission":"dive-op host ~10-20%","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["diveglobal"],"shelf_fit":{"diveglobal":"primary","liveaboard":"destination"},"commission_pct_low":10,"commission_pct_high":20,"commission_lane":["operator"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"band+lane"},{"name":"Wild American-crocodile in-water encounter (XTC)","status":"future","bookable_category":"expert-guided wildlife","tier":"premier","source":"https://xtcdivecenter.com/crocs/croc-encounters/","timing":"Dive peak May-Sep","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"handler-led encounter, world''s only permitted such experience ·","si":"expedition","blurb":"handler-led encounter, world''s only permitted such experience ·","when":"Dive peak May-Sep","commission":"dive-op host / on application; XTC sole permit","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["expedition"],"shelf_fit":{"diveglobal":"destination","expedition":"primary","liveaboard":"destination"},"commission_lane":["operator"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"}],"faq":[{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for diving Mahahual?","a":"Remote medevac - the load-bearing risk. Mahahual has NO hyperbaric chamber; the nearest DAN-certified chamber is in Cozumel, a multi-hour transit from a Chinchorro site ~25 miles offshore. Dive conservatively, hold no-fly 18-24h, and treat DCS as a logistics problem.","source":"costamed.com.mx","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"When is the best time to dive Mahahual and Chinchorro?","a":"May-September - the counterintuitive answer: calmest seas, best visibility (~15-30m) and the crocodile season (Jun 1-Sep 30), even though it overlaps the rainy/hurricane months. Winter (Nov-Mar) sees more wind and Chinchorro is often blown out.","source":"coralrealm.com","si_tag":"diveglobal"},{"q":"Can I day-dive Banco Chinchorro, and how?","a":"Yes - most Mahahual/Xcalak operators run day-trips for certified divers: a 2-tank ($275) or 3-tank ($325) day with a Cayo Centro stop, an 80-90-minute crossing each way. The operator handles the limited federal permit when you book; May-September has the calmest seas.","source":"xtcdivecenter.com","si_tag":"diveglobal"},{"q":"Can you really swim with wild crocodiles at Chinchorro?","a":"Yes - it''s the only legally permitted in-water wild-crocodile encounter on Earth, and only XTC Dive Center holds the federal permit. The season is a hard window of June 1 to September 30, capped at 6 people (2 in the water with the handler at a time), flotation device required. Book far ahead.","source":"xtcdivecenter.com","si_tag":"globaladv"},{"q":"What is the Banco Chinchorro liveaboard experience actually like?","a":"It''s a stilt-hut expedition, not a cruise ship. Multi-day trips overnight in a palafito on Cayo Centro - a basic 2x2m stilt-deck fishing hut with hammocks and no services - legalized in 2010. It''s the closest access to the remote walls and ~200 wrecks; permit-scarce, so book the specialist operator well ahead.","source":"pepedivemahahual.com","si_tag":"liveaboard"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Mahahual & Banco Chinchorro: Atoll Diving Guide","meta_description":"Mahahual is the gateway to Banco Chinchorro - the Northern Hemisphere''s largest coral atoll: ~200 wrecks, croc encounters, and the remote-chamber realities.","slug":"mahahual-mexico","primary_keyword":"Banco Chinchorro diving","long_tail":["Mahahual Banco Chinchorro dive","Chinchorro liveaboard palafito","Chinchorro crocodile snorkel XTC","Costa Maya diving","Xcalak scuba diving"],"search_language":"es","local_keywords":["buceo Banco Chinchorro","Mahahual buceo Costa Maya","encuentro con cocodrilos Xcalak","buceo Xcalak","atolon Chinchorro liveaboard palafito"],"hreflang":["en","es-MX"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-07-04","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-07-04","last_verified_basis":"source_verified","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/mexico","read":"2026-08-20T14:49:02Z","source_updated":"2026-07-16T16:08:09+01:00"}]}},"booking":{"codes":[],"note":"the real planning is dive-medevac (nearest chamber Cozumel), not crime; MXN currency, dive prices often USD-quoted","advisory_authority":"FCDO"},"si_checklist_25":{"run_date":"2026-07-30","hits":4,"misses":18,"disregarded":3,"note":"Canonical 25-SI list; Banco Chinchorro moat = largest N-Hemisphere atoll (~200 wrecks) + sole permitted wild-crocodile encounter (XTC); sports limited to participant; spectator/prosports/compsports disregarded"},"sis_present":[{"si":"liveaboard","name":"liveaboard","status":"live","note":"overnight-palafito multi-day on Cayo Centro (stilt-hut, not a cruise ship)"},{"si":"diveglobal","name":"diveglobal","status":"live"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Private crewed Chinchorro dive charter / private palafito buy-out","why_ultra":"exclusive-use permitted multi-day atoll expedition - the rarest dive product in Mexican waters (permit-scarce, ~200 wrecks, sole-group access)","earning":"on application (dive-op/charter host / liveaboard-reseller)","virtuoso_value_add":"none formal (specialist dive charter, not a consortia hotel)","mor":"commission-on-net, agent-of-record; no net-rate resale"},{"name":"Nearest branded ultra = Riviera Maya (Mayakoba: Rosewood/Banyan Tree; Maroma A Belmond)","why_ultra":"n/a locally - branded-residence ultra sits far north; route ultra client Mahahual-for-dive + Riviera-Maya-for-stay","earning":"via host-Virtuoso (see Playa del Carmen / Puerto Morelos dossiers)","virtuoso_value_add":"upgrade / breakfast / resort credit (per those dossiers)","mor":"commission-on-net"}],"source_verified":"2026-07-04","hero":{"query":"Mahahual (Costa Maya & Banco Chinchorro), Mexico"},"geo":{"lat":18.7167,"lng":-87.7167},"orbit":[{"id":"akumal-mexico","jewels":5,"si":["diveglobal","ocean","culture"]},{"id":"bacalar-mexico","jewels":6,"si":["tropical","wellness","adventure"]},{"id":"cancun-mexico","jewels":5,"si":["tropical","adventure","diveglobal","ocean"]},{"id":"coba-mexico","jewels":5,"si":["culture","expedition","family"]},{"id":"cozumel-mexico","jewels":5,"si":["diveglobal","liveaboard","ocean"]},{"id":"holbox-mexico","jewels":4,"si":["expedition","romance","ocean","wildlife"]},{"id":"isla-contoy-mexico","jewels":3,"si":["expedition","ocean","wildlife"]},{"id":"isla-mujeres-mexico","jewels":5,"si":["tropical","ocean","diveglobal","adventure"]},{"id":"playa-del-carmen-mexico","jewels":5,"si":["romance","expedition","diveglobal","culture"]},{"id":"puerto-aventuras-mexico","jewels":5,"si":["romance","diveglobal","ocean","wil