s, helmet and stated weight limits before booking with Selvatura, Sky Adventures or 100% Aventura — high-speed lines and Superman/Tarzan configurations raise the stakes.","source":"selvatura.com, 2026-07-06","si_tag":"safety","accessed":"2026-07-06"},{"q":"How hard is the drive to Monteverde?","a":"It''s a real mountain climb. Monteverde sits at ~1,400 m, roughly 3–4 hours from Juan Santamaría (SJO), with the final stretch a rough, partly-unpaved and fog-prone road — drive in daylight, 4WD recommended, allow extra time.","source":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/costa-rica","si_tag":"safety"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Monteverde Cloud Forest, Costa Rica: Quetzals, Ziplines & Cloud-Forest Lodges | TravelWell.World","meta_description":"Plan Monteverde - the original cloud-forest zipline, resplendent-quetzal birding, hanging bridges, night walks, and boutique eco-lodges. Best times, safety, and how to book.","search_language":"es-CR","local_keywords":["bosque nuboso Monteverde","canopy Monteverde","reserva Santa Elena","quetzal Monteverde temporada","puentes colgantes Monteverde","tour nocturno Monteverde","hoteles ecologicos Monteverde","como llegar a Monteverde"],"hreflang":["en","es-CR"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-07-06","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-07-06","last_verified_basis":"source_verified","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/costa-rica","read":"2026-08-20T14:54:18Z","source_updated":"2026-05-19T11:42:25+01:00"}]},"long_tail":["Monteverde cloud forest guide 2026","best zipline in Monteverde","resple