calm and reef-protected, making it the gentlest swim on the peninsula and its best family beach for kayaking, snorkeling and SUP — a gentler alternative to the surf breaks at Guiones and Santa Teresa.","source":"costaricarios.com, 2026-07-06","si_tag":"tropical","accessed":"2026-07-06"},{"q":"Is Nosara good for beginner surfers?","a":"Yes — Playa Guiones is a forgiving beach break with surf schools and whitewater, and Nosara sees 300+ surfable days a year, so beginners can learn nearly any day. Advanced surfers should head to the heavier point/reef swell at Santa Teresa / Mal País instead.","source":"vacationscostarica.com, 2026-07-06","si_tag":"expedition","accessed":"2026-07-06"},{"q":"When is the Ostional turtle arribada?","a":"Year-round, but it peaks Jul–Nov and is biggest Sep–Oct, when up to ~500,000 olive-ridleys come ashore. Events cluster on the ~28-day lunar cycle — around the last-quarter moon and the dark nights just before the new moon — and access is guided-only.","source":"volunteerlatinamerica.com, 2026-07-06","si_tag":"expedition","accessed":"2026-07-06"},{"q":"Is Nosara or Santa Teresa better for a honeymoon?","a":"Both work — pick your mood. Nosara pairs wellness-retreat honeymoons with its lived-in yoga scene; Santa Teresa / Mal País is the remote boho-luxury surf-and-sunset coast, with elite jungle-beach villas and barefoot-ultra properties like Latitude 10 for total privacy.","source":"vacationscostarica.com, 2026-07-06","si_tag":"romance","accessed":"2026-07-06"},{"q":"What is the Nicoya Blue Zone?","a":"It''s Costa Rica''s official Blue Zone — one of only five global longevity zones. A 2013 study found the region had roughly 3–4× the global proportion of centenarians, and Nosara''s yoga culture is local and lived-in, not imported for tourists.","source":"specialplacesofcostarica.com, 2026-07-06","si_tag":"wellness-&-spa-—-future","accessed":"2026-07-06"},{"q":"What''s the #1 safety risk on this coast?","a":"Rip currents.","source":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/costa-rica","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"Can anyone watch the Ostional arribada?","a":"No — access is guided-only. Ostional is a community-managed refuge where guided access is mandatory, with no lights or flash and no touching, respecting nesting-window rules; unguided night beach access is both a wildlife-harm and personal-safety issue.","source":"wcanosara.org, 2026-07-06","si_tag":"safety","accessed":"2026-07-06"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Nosara & the Nicoya Peninsula, Costa Rica — Blue Zone Yoga, Surf & Turtle Coast | TravelWell.World","jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-07-06","search_language":"es-CR","local_keywords":["Nosara yoga surf","Santa Teresa Costa Rica","Península de Nicoya playas","arribada Ostional","Zona Azul Nicoya longevidad","retiro de yoga Nosara"],"hreflang":["en","es-CR"],"attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-07-06","last_verified_basis":"source_verified","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/costa-rica","read":"2026-08-20T14:54:18Z","source_updated":"2026-05-19T11:42:25+01:00"}]}},"booking":{"advisory_authority":"FCDO"},"si_checklist_25":null,"sis_present":["Tropical Islands & Beaches (LIVE)","GEA (LIVE)","Wellness & Spa (FUTURE)"],"ultra":[{"name":"Latitude 10 Exclusive Beach Resort","location":"Santa Teresa","tier":"ultra","path":"MoR + Fora/consortia amenity"},{"name":"Hotel Nantipa","location":"Santa Teresa","tier":"luxury-ultra","path":"SLH/consortia + MoR"},{"name":"The Harmony Hotel","location":"Nosara","tier":"luxury","path":"consortia + MoR"},{"name":"Bodhi Tree Yoga Re